崩れ落ちそうな身体 抱きしめるから
I'll hold your crumbling body tight.

2016
01:56:35,771 --> 01:56:38,171
We choose to know

2017
01:56:38,171 --> 01:56:41,371
The struggles of this scuffed up page we're living in
The struggles of this scuffed-up page we're living in

2018
01:56:41,371 --> 01:56:45,171
腐ったクズの日々だけど
Even though these rotten days are like scum,

2019
01:56:45,171 --> 01:56:48,171
この夜明け could seem a lot like "not your day"
this dawn could seem a lot like "not your day."

2020
01:56:48,171 --> 01:56:52,171
それでも貴方を捨ててしまわないで
Even so, don't throw away who you are.

2021
01:57:02,371 --> 01:57:05,171
Can't find a reason to stay

2022
01:57:05,171 --> 01:57:07,871
Some busted world led astray

2023
