2035
01:57:45,671 --> 01:57:48,671
This cynical mind says "Why'd you try?"

2036
01:57:48,671 --> 01:57:52,371
"Why not give up and play the bad guy?"

2037
01:57:52,871 --> 01:57:55,871
分からないんだ
I don't understand.

2038
01:57:56,371 --> 01:58:00,371
埃まみれの街で 貴方のため息の影
In this dust-covered town, the shadow of your sigh...

2039
