私の微かな火で照らしたいだけ
I just want to illuminate it with my faint flame.

2040
01:58:07,171 --> 01:58:09,671
We choose to know

2041
01:58:09,671 --> 01:58:12,971
The struggles of this scuffed up page we're giving in
The struggles of this scuffed-up page we're giving in

2042
01:58:12,971 --> 01:58:16,871
土砂に汚れて be real, it hurts to grow
Stained in mud and dirt, be real, it hurts to grow.

