01:59:10,871 --> 01:59:14,171
Why don't we turn this scuffed up page we're writing in
Why don't we turn this scuffed-up page we're writing in?

2056
01:59:14,171 --> 01:59:17,971
こんな世界じゃ be real, I think we know
In a world like this, be real, I think we know.

